# Declare independence, then two turns of the War of Independence: the REF lands and fights.
# Start: map_declare_independence's input.sav (France, Spring 1599, turn 107; every French colony at 59% SoL)
# with every French unit that had no orders / go-to / pioneer job put on sentry (orders 1), so only
# units the war wakes need attention. The declaration steps are map_declare_independence's.
# Turn 107 end: the Crown's first wave lands near Montreal (@INVASION, ai_king_0982_invasion, raised
# inside the King's beat while the AI turn runs). Turn 108 end: a second wave lands near Montreal,
# the Tories beat the defenders, march into Montreal (captured, colony owner -> crown slot 2) and
# defeat/capture rebels near Guadeloupe. Ends at the start of Autumn 1600 (turn 109).
click 22 3               # GAME menu
click 50 85              # DECLARE INDEPENDENCE: Never / Yes confirm
wait 1
click 150 162            # Yes!: WoI, rival slots, congress latch, backup force, Euro withdrawal, REF diplo
wait 2
key Return               # War of the Spanish Succession notice (Spain cedes New Spain to the Dutch)
wait 2
key Return               # signing cinematic: skip the animation to the finished signature
wait 2
key Return               # close the cinematic
wait 2
key Return               # @INDEPENDENCE letter OK; every rebel unit's moves are spent: End of Turn
wait 2
key space                # end turn 107
wait 30
key Return               # Royal Expeditionary Force lands near Montreal (nested in the King's beat)
wait 10
key Return               # SoL Port au Prince 62% (Continue turn)
wait 10
key Return               # hint: the King's armies and New World tactics (ambush bonus)
wait 10
key Return               # Netherlands considers intervention (8000 bells)
wait 10
key Return               # SoL Martinique 62% (Continue turn)
wait 10
key Return               # SoL Guadeloupe 62% (Continue turn)
wait 10
key Return               # SoL Montreal 60% (Continue turn)
wait 10
key Return               # SoL Quebec 61% (Continue turn)
wait 10
key Return               # Continental Army mobilizes at Quebec (Veteran Dragoons promoted)
wait 10
shot
key s                    # turn 108: sentry the Scout the war woke (29,62)
wait 3
shot
key s                    # sentry the Preacher at (44,22): End of Turn
wait 3
shot
key space                # end turn 108
wait 30
shot
key Return               # AI turn popups (second landing near Montreal, Tory victories, Montreal captured, captures near Guadeloupe); some presses land between popups and are ignored
wait 10
